{'symbol': 'LEN', 'date': '2021-06-23 13:59:00', 'title': 'LMC HUMAN RESOURCES DIRECTOR NICOLE BROWN ACCEPTED INTO FORBES HUMAN RESOURCES COUNCIL', 'text': 'DALLAS, JUNE 23, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 LMC , A WHOLLY OWNED SUBSIDIARY OF LENNAR CORPORATION AND A LEADER IN APARTMENT DEVELOPMENT AND MANAGEMENT, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT HUMAN RESOURCES DIRECTOR NICOLE BROWN HAS BEEN ACCEPTED INTO THE FORBES HUMAN RESOURCES COUNCIL, AN INVITATION-ONLY COMMUNITY FOR HR EXECUTIVES ACROSS INDUSTRIES. BROWN WAS VETTED AND SELECTED BY A REVIEW COMMITTEE BASED ON THE DEPTH AND DIVERSITY OF HER EXPERIENCE.'}